<script setup>
import {ref} from 'vue';import {api} from '../api';
const symbol=ref('AAPL'),strategy=ref('breakout'),result=ref(null),error=ref(''),busy=ref(false);
async function run(){busy.value=true;error.value='';result.value=null;try{result.value=await api(`/backtest?symbol=${symbol.value}&strategy=${strategy.value}`)}catch(e){error.value=e.message}finally{busy.value=false}}
</script><template><h1>回测实验室</h1><p>120 根合成价格；次根收盘成交，持有 3 根；每边费用 10bp。结果仅验证流程，不代表收益预期。</p><label>标的 <select v-model="symbol"><option>AAPL</option><option>MSFT</option><option>00700.HK</option></select></label><label>策略 <select v-model="strategy"><option>breakout</option><option>mean_reversion</option></select></label><button :disabled="busy" @click="run">{{busy?'运行中…':'运行回测'}}</button><p role="alert">{{error}}</p><section v-if="result"><div class="metrics"><article>收益 {{result.returnPct}}%</article><article>最大回撤 {{result.maxDrawdownPct}}%</article><article>开仓 {{result.trades}} 次</article></div><svg viewBox="0 0 600 160" role="img" aria-label="模拟权益曲线"><polyline fill="none" stroke="#45d6af" stroke-width="2" :points="result.equity.map((v,i)=>`${i*600/119},${145-(v-Math.min(...result.equity))/Math.max(1,Math.max(...result.equity)-Math.min(...result.equity))*130}`).join(' ')"/></svg><p>期末持仓按末价估值；未强制平仓。无股息、汇率、交易日历、滑点及港股整手约束。</p></section></template>
